  "additional_concerns": [
    "All candidates omit an executable dependency on the referenced FAQs, forms and checklists; their unavailable contents prevent verification of any further operational qualifications.",
    "node.b66b3e831bb98a12db59dffa can return TRUE for a pending pre-effective application, although source unit d97b56331f41a.u10.1809 preserves the existing approval or authorisation process for such applications.",
    "The other candidates treat a pending pre-effective application as excluding relief for the change itself; d97b56331f41a.u10.1809 expressly governs processing existing applications, so a categorical change-level exclusion beyond that processing context needs clarification.",
    "The source fixes the effective date but does not fully specify which event date controls every transitional situation; an assessment_date input alone does not resolve that issue.",
    "None of the candidates represents continuing SFC post-vetting; TRUE establishes at most the modeled prior-approval relief, not exemption from subsequent supervision or complete post-authorisation compliance."
